    "created_at": "2016-01-19T19:17:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-19T19:17:25Z",
    "body": "I don't work on these things any more so I can't really provide implementation feedback.\n\nHowever the feature sounds sensible to me. Though sounds like we should have more than just a boolean so that you can control more than just \"show vs. hide\" on the lockscreen?\n",
