    "created_at": "2016-01-20T10:56:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-20T10:56:19Z",
    "body": "Yes an enum would capture the Android feature set better. I'm not sure what, if anything, other platforms expose for this. It would be nice to have at least one other platform to compare and contrast with.\n",
